{"id":"657560","name":"葱香烤羊排","author":"五加五左左","authorId":"11514294","desc":"","cover":"images/657560/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"羊排","amount":"1000g"}],"sub":[{"name":"洋葱","amount":"1个"},{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"1个"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"羊排切块。","img":"images/657560/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"泡水两个小时，泡出血水。","img":"images/657560/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"泡好的羊排，控水擦干水分。","img":"images/657560/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"洋葱和蒜去皮。","img":"images/657560/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"洋葱和蒜打碎。","img":"images/657560/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加一点蚝油。","img":"images/657560/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加一勺面粉。","img":"images/657560/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"搅拌均匀成腌料。","img":"images/657560/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"把腌料裹在羊排上。","img":"images/657560/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"羊排裹上腌料以后，装袋子里，放冰箱腌制两个小时。","img":"images/657560/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"胡萝卜和另一半洋葱，去皮。","img":"images/657560/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"洋葱胡萝卜切块铺在烤盘底上。","img":"images/657560/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"腌好的羊排铺在烤盘上。","img":"images/657560/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"盖上锡纸，包住，180℃烤一个小时。","img":"images/657560/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"一个小时烤好以后，撕掉锡纸。","img":"images/657560/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"继续烤20分钟。","img":"images/657560/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"撒上烧烤料，继续烤20分钟。","img":"images/657560/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"翻面撒烧烤料再烤20分钟，后面两次要盯着烤箱，别烤糊了。","img":"images/657560/step_18.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：烤箱\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}